<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold prices seen mixed on low demand.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold prices seen mixed on low demand.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold prices are expected to remain mixed in the week starting Monday due to low demand of gold, dealers at the Karachi Saraffa (bullion) market said.</p>
<p>Low demand from jewellers would keep the prices depressed, one dealer said.</p>
<p>    Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grammes Saturday   March 22</p>
<p>							 4,706	4,749</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   7,715	7,715</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
